    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"inevitable\"... you mean the fact that there's no coming back from this. it feels like i've already died socially. there is no version of my life where i'm not this person they all hate. it's just exhausting trying to exist in a world where you've been completely cast out. it feels more like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life.",
